          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Spikes in arms and hardware deliveries mobilize defense industry PACs, pro-aid advocacy networks, and aligned donor communities, increasing campaign contributions to candidates who support or oppose the policy line." />
