          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger escalation feedback loops in the Hormuz theatre increase perceived risk of a wider regional confrontation, prompting executives to reduce confrontational measures elsewhere (i.e., ease punitive pressure and increase engagement with Russia) to avoid simultaneous high-risk fronts." />
