          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sharp increase in media coverage of battlefield losses, civilian suffering, or urgent capability gaps amplifies public and legislative pressure on executives, accelerating approvals and emergency provision of arms and hardware shipments." />
